%% MUPP-074 Amount on Secret Santa groups
%% The administrator sets the amount; members and the draw mail show it.
flowchart TD
    A[Administrator saves the group form] --> B{Amount empty or a whole number above 0?}
    B -- no --> C[Message at the field, nothing saved]
    C --> A
    B -- yes --> D[ss_event.amount saved, or NULL when empty]
    D --> E[Group card in admin shows N kr - R4]
    D --> F[Member's own page shows N kr beside Hej - R2]
    D --> G[Draw mail 3 says Beloppet är N kr - R3]
